WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.532
Chasing details. Checking rates. Preparing another quote.

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:06.676
Meanwhile, new inquiries are waiting for a reply.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:10.272
Turn customer inquiries into clear quotes.

00:00:10.407 --> 00:00:12.913
Capture the location, area and frequency.

00:00:13.056 --> 00:00:15.358
Check the scope. Ask for missing details.

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.179
Your rates calculate the price.

00:00:17.294 --> 00:00:19.430
Review the quote, then approve and send.

00:00:19.532 --> 00:00:23.037
Follow-up drafts need approval. A reply stops the sequence.

00:00:23.167 --> 00:00:28.252
Once your team confirms acceptance, prepare the operations brief
and confirm the schedule.

00:00:28.393 --> 00:00:34.046
Cleaning is one example. Tailor this to maintenance, landscaping
or repairs, using your rules.

00:00:34.225 --> 00:00:37.134
Clear scope. Consistent prices. You approve.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:43.165
Curious how this could fit your business? Send me a message.
Let’s explore it.

